%% RIBAT — System Archaeology / End-to-End Architecture
%% Legend: solid = implemented or represented in MVP; dashed = future production boundary; dotted = public/redacted output.
flowchart LR
  classDef actor fill:#242522,color:#fff,stroke:#242522,stroke-width:2px
  classDef input fill:#fff8ee,color:#5c3b1f,stroke:#e58a3a,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef privacy fill:#e7f4f1,color:#155f5a,stroke:#187c76,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef registry fill:#eeeaf7,color:#55447e,stroke:#7665a8,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef public fill:#eaf0f5,color:#405d76,stroke:#4e7293,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef state fill:#fbfaf7,color:#242522,stroke:#8a8b83,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef risk fill:#fff2e4,color:#7b4a1c,stroke:#e58a3a,stroke-width:2px
  classDef future fill:#f5f5f1,color:#73746d,stroke:#96978d,stroke-dasharray: 5 4
  classDef note fill:#f7f5ef,color:#65665f,stroke:#c9c6bc,stroke-dasharray: 2 3

  subgraph A[01 · PEOPLE AND ENTRY POINTS]
    L[Lender A / risk officer]:::actor
    O[Operations officer]:::actor
    D[Debtor / buyer]:::actor
    S[Supplier / SME]:::actor
    G[Guardian pool<br/>lawyer · arbitrator · notary]:::actor
    R[Regulator / insurer / auditor]:::actor
    UI[Console UI<br/>Check · Journal · Due process]:::input
    API[Gateway API<br/>auth · rate limit · audit log]:::future
  end

  subgraph B[02 · RECEIVABLE INTAKE AND NORMALISATION]
    I0[Receivable candidate node N0<br/>invoice or bill of exchange<br/>raw fields stay with lender]:::input
    F1[Reference / instrument type]:::input
    F2[Supplier + buyer identifiers]:::input
    F3[Issue date + amount]:::input
    F4[TTN / El Fatoora reference<br/>when available]:::input
    V[Schema validation<br/>required fields · format · jurisdiction]:::state
    C[Canonicalisation function<br/>same economics → comparable form]:::privacy
    K1[INV1 candidate<br/>supplier · buyer · reference · date]:::privacy
    K2[INV2 candidate<br/>official e-invoice / TTN reference]:::privacy
    K3[INV3 candidate<br/>supplier · buyer · date · amount]:::privacy
  end

  subgraph C[03 · PRIVACY BOUNDARY AND COLLISION CHECK]
    B1[Blind / hash / OPRF input<br/>production boundary]:::privacy
    Q[Query package Q<br/>blinded key candidates + member proof]:::privacy
    E[Private evaluation<br/>registry cannot read raw commercial fields]:::future
    DB[(Encrypted registry index<br/>candidate commitments)]:::future
    M[Match engine<br/>exact / reissued / ambiguous]:::privacy
    CLEAR{Collision?}:::state
    FALSE[False-positive review<br/>mediated disclosure only]:::risk
    BLOCKED[BLOCKED response<br/>senior rank + timestamp<br/>no lender identity]:::risk
    CLEAROUT[CLEAR response<br/>eligible to register]:::privacy
  end

  subgraph D[04 · ATOMIC REGISTRY AND STATE MACHINE]
    CLAIM[Claim node C<br/>nullifier · partyId · docHash<br/>status · rank · seniorAt]:::registry
    TX[Atomic compare-and-set<br/>if absent → create rank 1<br/>if present → reject later claim]:::registry
    SENIOR[Senior claim node C1<br/>rank 1 · consensus timestamp]:::state
    JUNIOR[Rejected / collision node C2<br/>no active priority created]:::risk
    ACTIVE[ACTIVE<br/>registered and eligible]:::state
    FROZEN[FROZEN<br/>dispute order executed]:::state
    RELEASED[RELEASED<br/>paid / discharged]:::state
    EXPIRED[EXPIRED<br/>order or claim window ended]:::state
  end

  subgraph E[05 · AUDIT, CONSENSUS AND PUBLIC PROOF]
    EV[Private-to-public event envelope<br/>eventType · nullifier · partyId<br/>rank · status · timestamp]:::public
    HCS[Hedera Consensus Service<br/>topic message / sequence number]:::public
    ROOT[Epoch root / Merkle root<br/>periodic integrity checkpoint]:::public
    MIRROR[Mirror indexer<br/>searchable event history]:::public
    VERIFY[Public Verify page<br/>redacted proof only]:::public
    PUB[Public fields only<br/>nullifier · pseudonymous partyId<br/>rank · status · timestamp · root]:::public
    SENSITIVE[Off-chain private store<br/>document · names · amount<br/>tax IDs · lender portfolio]:::future
  end

  subgraph F[06 · DUE PROCESS AND DISPUTE PATH]
    PROP[Freeze proposal node O<br/>reason · claim reference<br/>expiry · proposer signature]:::registry
    G1[Guardian 1 approval]:::actor
    G2[Guardian 2 approval]:::actor
    G3[Guardian 3 review / pending]:::actor
    QUORUM{Quorum reached?<br/>2 of 3}:::state
    LOCK[Time-lock window<br/>no immediate unilateral freeze]:::registry
    EXEC[Execute freeze order<br/>public ORDER + EXECUTED events]:::registry
    AUTO[Auto-expiry<br/>order expires unless renewed]:::registry
    APPEAL[Appeal / arbitration path]:::future
  end

  subgraph H[07 · RELEASE, INSURANCE AND ANALYTICS]
    PAY[Normal bank settlement<br/>outside RIBAT]:::actor
    RELEASE[Release claim]:::registry
    SCORE[LinkScore v0<br/>history · attestation · dispute state]:::registry
    CARD[Link Card JSON<br/>asset class · jurisdiction · score<br/>anchor · status]:::public
    METRICS[Aggregated metrics<br/>checks · collisions · value protected<br/>fees · HCS events]:::public
    INS[Insurer / guarantee fund<br/>warranty underwriting]:::future
  end

  L --> UI
  O --> UI
  UI --> I0
  D -. confirmation / dispute .-> UI
  S -. source data .-> I0
  I0 --> F1 & F2 & F3 & F4
  F1 & F2 & F3 & F4 --> V --> C
  C --> K1 & K2 & K3
  K1 & K2 & K3 --> B1 --> Q
  Q --> API
  API -. future protected call .-> E
  E --> DB --> M
  M --> CLEAR
  CLEAR -->|no| CLEAROUT --> TX
  CLEAR -->|yes| BLOCKED
  CLEAR -->|ambiguous| FALSE
  BLOCKED --> UI
  FALSE -->|resolved legitimate twin| CLEAROUT
  FALSE -->|confirmed conflict| BLOCKED
  TX -->|empty key set| CLAIM
  TX -->|existing commitment| JUNIOR
  CLAIM --> SENIOR --> ACTIVE
  ACTIVE --> EV
  JUNIOR --> EV
  EV --> HCS --> MIRROR
  HCS --> ROOT
  MIRROR --> VERIFY --> PUB
  SENSITIVE -. never published .-> VERIFY
  CLAIM -. private document hash relation .-> SENSITIVE
  ACTIVE -->|challenge| PROP
  PROP --> G1 & G2 & G3
  G1 & G2 & G3 --> QUORUM
  QUORUM -->|no| PROP
  QUORUM -->|yes| LOCK --> EXEC --> FROZEN
  EXEC --> EV
  LOCK -. expiry without quorum .-> AUTO
  FROZEN --> AUTO
  AUTO --> EXPIRED
  FROZEN -. appeal .-> APPEAL
  ACTIVE -->|invoice paid| PAY --> RELEASE --> RELEASED
  RELEASED --> EV
  ACTIVE --> SCORE --> CARD
  FROZEN --> SCORE
  MIRROR --> METRICS
  CARD --> L
  METRICS --> R
  SCORE -. future underwriting input .-> INS
  R -. oversight / aggregate data .-> METRICS

  N0[Small-node movement key<br/>N0 raw candidate → K1/K2/K3<br/>→ Q blinded package → C claim<br/>→ EV event → HCS message → root/index<br/>→ Verify proof / released state]:::note
  N0 -. traces .-> I0
  N0 -. traces .-> Q
  N0 -. traces .-> CLAIM
  N0 -. traces .-> EV
  N0 -. traces .-> VERIFY

